{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# LearnKG: Reusable Positive-Only Prerequisite Evaluation (PRAT & Geometry)\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook runs the positive-only prerequisite evaluation for **PRAT** (*Networking & Internet*) and **CK-12 Geometry** using the unified evaluation framework.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Evaluation Principles:\n",
    "- **Positive-Only Ground Truth**: Evaluates against known positive prerequisite pairs (`PREREQUISITE -> TARGET`).\n",
    "- **No Synthetic Negatives**: Zero unannotated pairs are assumed to be false negatives. Specificity and ROC-AUC are intentionally omitted.\n",
    "- **Separation**: Datasets, outputs, and reports remain strictly decoupled."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 1: Environment Setup & Repository Cloning\n",
    "Prepares the environment, clones the repository (if in Colab), and verifies input paths."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os\n",
    "import sys\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "\n",
    "IN_COLAB = 'google.colab' in sys.modules or Path('/content').exists()\n",
    "\n",
    "if IN_COLAB:\n",
    "    if not Path('/content/LearnKG').exists():\n",
    "        print('[*] Cloning LearnKG repository...')\n",
    "        !git clone -b ACL https://github.com/thegreatvoid/LearnKG.git /content/LearnKG\n",
    "    %cd /content/LearnKG\n",
    "\n",
    "if str(Path.cwd()) not in sys.path:\n",
    "    sys.path.insert(0, str(Path.cwd()))\n",
    "\n",
    "assert Path('data_input/PRAT/rawText.txt').exists(), 'Missing PRAT rawText.txt!'\n",
    "assert Path('data_input/PRAT/GOLD-PR_PairsOnly.tsv').exists(), 'Missing PRAT GOLD-PR_PairsOnly.tsv!'\n",
    "print('[+] Repository and PRAT dataset verified successfully. Working dir:', Path.cwd())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 2: Install Core Dependencies\n",
    "Install dependencies for parsing, graph manipulation, and evaluation."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!pip install -q pandas numpy networkx scipy pyvis pypdf"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 3: Run Extraction Pipeline on PRAT\n",
    "Extracts concepts and relationships from `data_input/PRAT/rawText.txt` into `data_output/PRAT/`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from educational_pipeline import run_educational_pipeline\n",
    "\n",
    "print('[*] Running LearnKG educational pipeline on PRAT raw textbook text...')\n",
    "concepts_csv, relations_csv, G = run_educational_pipeline(\n",
    "    data_dir='PRAT',\n",
    "    use_llm=False,\n",
    "    use_neural_model=False,\n",
    "    output_html='./docs/prat.html',\n",
    "    source_filename='rawText.txt',\n",
    ")\n",
    "print(f'[+] Pipeline finished. Extracted concepts: {G.number_of_nodes()}, relations: {G.number_of_edges()}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 4: Run Unified Positive-Only Evaluation\n",
    "Evaluates both PRAT and Geometry using the exact same evaluation function."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from kg_eval.evaluate_positive_only import evaluate_dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "# 1. Evaluate PRAT\n",
    "print('[*] Evaluating PRAT on positive-only benchmark...')\n",
    "report_prat = evaluate_dataset('prat')\n",
    "\n",
    "print('=' * 65)\n",
    "print('      PRAT POSITIVE-ONLY PREREQUISITE EVALUATION REPORT')\n",
    "print('=' * 65)\n",
    "print(f\"Gold Concepts Total      : {report_prat['gold_concepts_total']}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Gold Concepts Mapped     : {report_prat['gold_concepts_mapped']} ({report_prat['gold_concept_mapping_coverage']*100:.1f}%)\")\n",
    "print(f\"Gold Pairs Total         : {report_prat['gold_positive_pairs_total']}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Gold Pairs Evaluable     : {report_prat['gold_pairs_evaluable_subset']} ({report_prat['gold_pair_evaluable_coverage']*100:.1f}%)\")\n",
    "print(f\"Predicted Prereq Pairs   : {report_prat['predicted_prerequisite_pairs_unique']}\")\n",
    "print('-' * 65)\n",
    "print('EVALUABLE SUBSET (Pairs where both concepts mapped):')\n",
    "for k, v in report_prat['metrics_evaluable_subset'].items():\n",
    "    print(f\"  {k:<25}: {v}\")\n",
    "print('-' * 65)\n",
    "print(f\"FULL GOLD SET (All {report_prat['gold_positive_pairs_total']} unique gold pairs):\")\n",
    "for k, v in report_prat['metrics_full_gold_set'].items():\n",
    "    print(f\"  {k:<25}: {v}\")\n",
    "print('=' * 65)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 2. Reusability demonstration: Evaluate CK-12 Geometry with same function\n",
    "print('\\n[*] Reusability test: Evaluating CK-12 Geometry with the same evaluator...')\n",
    "report_geom = evaluate_dataset('geometry')\n",
    "print(f\"[+] Geometry Gold Pairs: {report_geom['gold_positive_pairs_total']}, Predicted Prereqs: {report_geom['predicted_prerequisite_pairs_unique']}, Evaluable TP: {report_geom['metrics_evaluable_subset']['TP']}\")\n",
    "print(f\"[+] Geometry Evaluable Precision: {report_geom['metrics_evaluable_subset']['Precision']}, Recall: {report_geom['metrics_evaluable_subset']['Recall']}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 5: Inspection of Samples & Generated Reports\n",
    "Review missed gold pairs, unmatched predictions, and verify saved reports."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print('\\n--- PRAT: Sample Missed Gold Pairs (First 5) ---')\n",
    "for item in report_prat['sample_missed_gold_pairs'][:5]:\n",
    "    print(f\"  [Gold PR] {item['prerequisite']} -> {item['target']} (Both mapped: {item['both_concepts_mapped']})\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print('\\n--- PRAT: Sample Unmatched Predictions ---')\n",
    "if report_prat['sample_unmatched_predictions']:\n",
    "    for item in report_prat['sample_unmatched_predictions'][:5]:\n",
    "        print(f\"  [Pred] {item['source']} -> {item['target']}\")\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print('  None (0 predicted prerequisite pairs extracted by deterministic baseline)')\n",
    "\n",
    "print('\\n--- Reports Generated ---')\n",
    "print('PRAT JSON Report    :', Path('data_output/PRAT/positive_only_evaluation_report.json').resolve())\n",
    "print('PRAT Markdown Report:', Path('data_output/PRAT/positive_only_evaluation_report.md').resolve())\n",
    "print('Geometry JSON Report:', Path('data_output/ck12_geometry/positive_only_evaluation_report.json').resolve())"
   ]
  }
 ],
